{"id":"ccbc16:puzzle:28","answer":"METIS","hints":[{"number":1,"title":"我毫无头绪","html":"<p>题目本应是五彩斑斓的，但是却被黑白打印而灰度化了。\n格中填入汉字。一个可能的切入点是右侧中间的连续四个带颜色的格子。</p>","text":"题目本应是五彩斑斓的，但是却被黑白打印而灰度化了。\n格中填入汉字。一个可能的切入点是右侧中间的连续四个带颜色的格子。","assetIds":[]},{"number":2,"title":"我应该填什么？","html":"<p>填俗语。右侧中间是“不分青红皂白”。</p>","text":"填俗语。右侧中间是“不分青红皂白”。","assetIds":[]},{"number":3,"title":"我填了一些了，但盘面太大还是很难，能不能再给我一个切入口","html":"<p>《》里的两个字是“论语”</p>","text":"《》里的两个字是“论语”","assetIds":[]}],"additionalAnswers":[],"solution":{"status":"available","format":"text","html":"<p>切入点是右侧中间的“不分青红皂白”。每行填入俗语，对应颜色的字已给出颜色，但是由于被灰度打印，因此无法判断颜色，需要一边推进一边推断。相邻的字符之间有分割线当且仅当这两个字符不同。</p>\n<p>填完后按顺序读①到⑧得到“九号小行星五字母”，得到最终答案 <code>METIS</code>。填完后的情况如下图所示：</p>\n<p><a data-asset-id=\"asset-3fe05015a16a18ee2667741d\" href=\"data/assets/static.cipherpuzzles.com/static/images/2d809f8cd2b542efabc42d8d58875ef0.webp\"><img data-asset-id=\"asset-3fe05015a16a18ee2667741d\" src=\"data/assets/static.cipherpuzzles.com/static/images/2d809f8cd2b542efabc42d8d58875ef0.webp\"/></a></p>","text":"切入点是右侧中间的“不分青红皂白”。每行填入俗语，对应颜色的字已给出颜色，但是由于被灰度打印，因此无法判断颜色，需要一边推进一边推断。相邻的字符之间有分割线当且仅当这两个字符不同。\n\n填完后按顺序读①到⑧得到“九号小行星五字母”，得到最终答案\nMETIS\n。填完后的情况如下图所示：","refId":null,"assetIds":["asset-3fe05015a16a18ee2667741d"]},"extended":{"html":"","text":"","assetIds":[]},"interactive":{"html":"<a href=\"https://static.cipherpuzzles.com/static/images/6a3dd69fdec64cb0848f86188fc12eb0.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">下载 PDF 文档</a><br>\n<a href=\"https://docs.qq.com/sheet/DVVFhT291aFJXY0JP?tab=000001\" target=\"_blank\">腾讯文档链接</a><br>\n<a href=\"https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1F8t2vnFuNqBL-T-SDRgHVmDAUYkkAZ-CNqpS28RelDs/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">Google Sheets 链接</a><br>\n题目内容请以PDF版为准。"},"sourceMetadata":{"type":1,"answer_type":0,"extend_data":"{\"pid\":28,\"imgUrl\":\"4023948e36d84cada06c454dc64e2a90.webp\",\"color\":\"#000\",\"top\":\"602px\",\"left\":\"1460px\"}","pgid":3,"pg_name":"印刷","resolved_extend_assets":["https://static.cipherpuzzles.com/static/images/4023948e36d84cada06c454dc64e2a90.webp"]},"failedAssets":[],"assets":[{"id":"asset-3fe05015a16a18ee2667741d","url":"https://static.cipherpuzzles.com/static/images/2d809f8cd2b542efabc42d8d58875ef0.webp","path":"data/assets/static.cipherpuzzles.com/static/images/2d809f8cd2b542efabc42d8d58875ef0.webp","mime":"image/webp","size":523590,"sha256":"b6e81382bec453094c673dfa98408f8fbb3c2160337084a7c8d25d5b4fb17d6f","status":"cached","error":"","roles":["solution"],"contexts":["solution"]},{"id":"asset-62bf81d6364fcb978475768f","url":"https://static.cipherpuzzles.com/static/images/4023948e36d84cada06c454dc64e2a90.webp","path":"data/assets/static.cipherpuzzles.com/static/images/4023948e36d84cada06c454dc64e2a90.webp","mime":"image/webp","size":1582,"sha256":"c7c240a23df0956aa537b6cfe7f8a19c6046e01bf59af853961b7592832e8054","status":"cached","error":"","roles":["puzzle"],"contexts":["sourceMetadata"]},{"id":"asset-889b900e0dae2bedc22a8a00","url":"https://static.cipherpuzzles.com/static/images/6a3dd69fdec64cb0848f86188fc12eb0.pdf","path":"data/assets/static.cipherpuzzles.com/static/images/6a3dd69fdec64cb0848f86188fc12eb0.pdf","mime":"application/pdf","size":26338,"sha256":"b6862e4b2b496a3035dde1b17f3060090230ae3019b2f8a80bb1725c733c444f","status":"cached","error":"","roles":["puzzle"],"contexts":["interactive"]}]}
